+    # Canonical record seq: source_root/publication/v2/publication-surface-revalidation-rN.json,
+    # N = predecessor_seq + 1 (deterministic, no latest-directory authority).
+    # Predecessor is the State pointer (supersedes): exact {path,sha256} or null.
+    # Unknown branch (unparseable predecessor path) refuses fail-closed.
+    # Existing rN collision refuses (ordinary activate must resume, never fork
+    # r3 over an existing complete orphan r2). Legacy max is inspected for
+    # declaration only, never used as next authority. Uses actual source_root
