+DAG: prior history + fresh before-State/selection + unchanged accepted inputs
+-> _observe_renewal_entry -> exclusive COPY claim + inventory -> basis LAST +
+pin recheck -> observe_renewal_authority -> Layer-A accepted content (SOURCE
