+(NOT actual R1x33, 33 small JSON, no build). Typed legacy root needs no high
+P3S tool semantic. Fresh independent code epoch: this test runs with DST
+fixed code (PYTHONPATH=DST, cwd=fixture copy), records DST source pins
+before data use. CLI32/33 actual State validate via public
+`python -m scripts.survey_agent_control_v2 validate-state`. New editorial
+preflight with chain31 allows32 vs32 refuses next33 via actual
+_build_anchor_chain + derive + len prewrite calls, no mocked
+validator-success. Negatives assert complete old State file SHA unchanged.
+No blanket catch, no typealias fallback. All scratch under workspace
+ignored .rephase-1-editorial-runtime, never /tmp quota/dev/shm/home.
+Own GitDir verified NOT reconstruct + inert/no sharing before writes.
